    "objective.omen1.report":"Present the Celestial Tear to Valerius.",
    "dialogue.omen1.offer":"My lord, the Veil Watch has detected a strange resonance above the Sky Castle. Will you hear my report?",
    "dialogue.omen1.start":"The air itself is trembling. Whatever waits there may threaten every realm, but we still have time to understand it.",
    "dialogue.omen1.lore":"Our oldest records call it an opening of the Veil—not an ending, but a warning that the world is changing.",
    "dialogue.omen1.go":"The Sky Castle marker is ready. When you are prepared, deploy your Champion and investigate.",
    "dialogue.omen1.arena_start":"Go carefully. Return with whatever truth you can recover.",
    "dialogue.omen1.failure":"You made it back—that matters more than one failed attempt. Regroup, and return when you are ready.",
    "dialogue.omen1.report":"You carry the same light our observers saw. Let me examine it.",
    "dialogue.omen1.report_conclusion":"A Celestial Tear... and it answers to you. Keep it. The Veil Watch will prepare your realm for what comes next.",
